new HashMap<>()  -> table is null  (allocated lazily on the first put)
after  1 puts    -> capacity 16, threshold 12
after 12 puts    -> capacity 16, threshold 12
after 13 puts    -> capacity 32, threshold 24

The 13th put crossed the threshold (16 x 0.75 = 12), so the table doubled to 32.

